    "The top-120 accuracy-first ensemble does not cover any band below top120; players outside the top 120 ADP carry the untouched incumbent forecast.",
    "The tail band posts the lowest MAE and often the highest Spearman of any band while almost never producing a startable season. Its MAE is deflated by near-zero actuals and its Spearman is rank noise around a floor. Do not read either as evidence the tail is well projected.",
